---
// CTA · editorial call to action
// Static section, no props needed
---

<!-- CTA · editorial call to action -->
<section class="relative bg-[#0A0A0A] w-full overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background cinematográfico -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: #0A0A0A;" />
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-50" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, #6366f128 0%, transparent 50%), radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 100%, #8b5cf610 0%, transparent 50%);" />
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.012] mix-blend-overlay pointer-events-none" style="background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=\'0 0 256 256\' xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%3E%3Cfilter id=\'noise\'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=\'fractalNoise\' baseFrequency=\'0.9\' numOctaves=\'4\' stitchTiles=\'stitch\'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=\'100%25\' height=\'100%25\' filter=\'url(%23noise)\' opacity=\'1\'/%3E%3C/svg%3E'); background-repeat: repeat; background-size: 256px 256px;" />
  <!-- Líneas decorativas -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px]" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #6366f144, transparent);" />
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px]" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #6366f122, transparent);" />

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-28 md:py-36 lg:py-44 text-center">
    <div class="reveal-group">
      <!-- Anotación manuscrita · hablemos -->
      <div class="reveal-item flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 -rotate-1 w-fit mx-auto font-hand text-lg md:text-xl mb-6 md:mb-8" style="color: #fde68a;">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6ee7b7" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"/></svg>
        Hablemos
      </div>

      <!-- Título -->
      <h2 class="reveal-item text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl xl:text-8xl font-heading font-bold text-white leading-[0.95] tracking-[-1.5px] md:tracking-[-2px] lg:tracking-[-3px]">
        Listo para impulsar<br />
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text" style="background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #a5b4fc);">tu negocio?</span>
        <svg class="block w-[42%] mx-auto h-3 mt-2" viewBox="0 0 300 10" preserveAspectRatio="none" fill="none" stroke="#6ee7b7" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 7c50-5 100 5 150 0s100-5 144-1" /></svg>
      </h2>

      <!-- Garabato separador -->
      <svg class="reveal-item mx-auto my-8 md:my-10 block w-24 h-2.5" viewBox="0 0 300 10" preserveAspectRatio="none" fill="none" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 7c50-5 100 5 150 0s100-5 144-1" /></svg>

      <!-- Descripción -->
      <p class="reveal-item mx-auto max-w-xl text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg text-white/50 font-body font-light leading-relaxed">
        Conversemos sin compromiso. Te ayudamos a definir la mejor estrategia digital para tu empresa en el sur de Chile.
      </p>

      <!-- CTA + teléfono -->
      <div class="reveal-item mt-10 md:mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-5">
        <a
          href="/contacto"
          class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-7 md:px-8 py-3.5 md:py-4 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.15em] uppercase -rotate-1 transition-all duration-300 hover:rotate-0"
          style="color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(99,102,241,0.25);"
        >
          <span>Contáctanos</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17L17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
        </a>
        <span class="text-[11px] md:text-xs text-white/30 font-body tracking-wide">o llama al <span class="text-white/50">+56966929818</span></span>
      </div>

      <!-- Trust signals · notas manuscritas -->
      <div class="reveal-item mt-12 md:mt-14 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-7 gap-y-4">
        {[
          { label: "Sin compromiso", accent: "#6366f1", rot: "-rotate-2" },
          { label: "Respuesta en 24 hrs", accent: "#10b981", rot: "rotate-1" },
          { label: "Atención personalizada", accent: "#f59e0b", rot: "-rotate-1" },
        ].map((t) => (
          <span class={`inline-flex items-center gap-2 ${t.rot} font-hand text-base md:text-lg transition-transform duration-300 hover:rotate-0`} style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke={t.accent} stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            {t.label}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
